comments[12]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-31T23:07:57.955Z","harness:codex","Scope disposition 2026-08-01: this tranche is implementing the upstream budget reachability, cursor-chain amortization, and egress receipt semantics first. The usage-ledger correction requires the SDK-owned context/next extraction still open on pm-z5pmf8 so it can consume the exact post-egress delivered rows without adding a second projection pass inside CLI commands. Leaving this distinct data-quality item open and unclaimed; no source edit is being made for it in this PR."
  "2026-09-01T15:48:15.172Z","harness:codex","Delivery evidence 2026-09-01: context and next now attach an internal serving receipt, defer ledger finalization until the actual CLI/SDK/MCP projection is known, and write schema-v2 serve plus delivery records correlated by serve_id. Included rows are the exact IDs emitted after final egress; suppressed payloads record omitted=true and an empty delivered_item_ids set. Affinity consumes only correlated delivered IDs and excludes legacy/pre-delivery phantom inclusions. The final-output boundary is set before hooks and telemetry, and feedback persistence degrades to explicit warnings without replacing a successful read. Temporary-project acceptance produced 22 ledger events including 8 delivery records, all correlated, with a deliberately one-token omitted next response recording no delivered IDs. Exact coverage passed 596 files / 8260 tests at 100/100/100/100; strict static, SDK surface, package, npx/bunx, and installed npm/Bun acceptance all passed."
  "2026-09-01T17:16:29.412Z","harness:codex","Review round evidence: affinity now requires a correlated v2 delivery and never trusts pre-egress delivered_item_ids; serving IDs normalize once; serve rows retain packed_item_ids only; quiet, host-suppressed, service-rendered, and custom-rendered output produce explicit zero-delivery omission receipts; object service projections retain the symbol receipt; delivery-write failure no longer prevents authoritative touches; evaluation fixtures now model serve-delivery-touch. Linked focused suite passed 72/72 and exact repo coverage passed 100/100/100/100."
  "2026-09-01T18:28:29.996Z","harness:codex","Late-review hardening evidence: handled output_format services that return primitives or arrays now preserve the serving receipt on an explicit result_omitted carrier. Object service results retain their structured receipt path; strings, quiet mode, and custom renderers remain explicit omissions. Focused output suite passed 39/39."
  "2026-09-01T21:41:04.913Z","harness:codex","Exact-head review implementation: delivery finalization now deduplicates serve_id under the ledger lock and the affinity fold preserves the first correlated delivery in legacy ledgers; repeated empty finalization cannot erase a prior positive delivery."
  "2026-09-01T22:27:17.924Z","harness:codex","Terminal exact-head evidence: repeated SDK delivery finalization in a fresh temporary acceptance root persisted exactly one delivery for the served item. The repo-wide coverage gate passed at 100/100/100/100 (61,007 statements and 46,099 branches), and pnpm quality:static passed in full. Delivery append deduplicates serve_id while holding the ledger lock, and affinity retains the first correlated delivery for legacy duplicate ledgers so a retry cannot erase earlier positive feedback."
  "2026-09-01T23:05:05.579Z","harness:codex","Final review verification: the exact pre-egress negative control now asserts the full packed set, the focused suite passed, and repo-wide exact coverage passed at 100/100/100/100. The first linked quality:static attempt failed only at the expected terminal-defect gate while this issue and pm-07pt16 were reopened; closing both before the terminal rerun."
  "2026-09-02T00:10:59.497Z","harness:codex","Exact-head implementation: next-surface delivery extraction now includes recommended, ready, decision_needed, and blocked queues, deduplicated through the existing served-subset validation. CLI and PmClient integration assertions cover all emitted queues and explicitly require a non-empty positive delivery. The canonical five-file egress suite passes 75/75, including complete-queue unit correlation and omitted-output controls."
  "2026-09-02T00:17:39.121Z","harness:codex","Shared post-implementation evidence: commit 7d7d5fe24 contains complete next-queue delivery extraction and non-vacuity assertions; the canonical pm-07pt16 linked coverage execution run after that commit passed all 8,260 tests at exact 100/100/100/100 (61,013 statements, 46,117 branches, 12,701 functions, 58,731 lines)."
  "2026-09-02T00:25:01.952Z","harness:codex","Terminal static evidence: pnpm quality:static passed against implementation commit 7d7d5fe24 after this issue and pm-07pt16 were closed. The full repository assurance, SDK/package parity, graph, duplicate, contract, and record-integrity chain is green."
  "2026-09-02T00:41:00.929Z","harness:codex","Fresh-review implementation: the next serving receipt now carries every item-bearing queue actually assembled for egress, including decision_needed, blocked, and held_by_others, while preserving ready scorer propensity rows. Final delivery extraction covers the same queues. Isolated CLI acceptance now creates and requires all three non-ready queue classes, so the former validation failure is reproduced and prevented; the two-file focused run passed 26/26."
  "2026-09-02T00:48:43.749Z","harness:codex","Coverage negative-control evidence: the first post-648dfbaa3 repository run passed all 8,260 tests but correctly failed the exact gate at 46,120/46,121 branches, identifying a defensive duplicate branch that cannot occur because ready, decision, blocked, and held queues are mutually exclusive by construction. Removed that artificial branch; the canonical 75-test egress suite passes again before the final coverage rerun."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-01T15:48:17.781Z","harness:codex","Usage feedback is valid only at final egress: preserve the pre-egress serve for correlation, but train affinity exclusively from the post-projection delivered ID set and represent omission explicitly."
